{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH30CJRP8Z8XY1EJT9AJCS8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日なにもない日はなんかワクワクしちゃって寝れなくて友達とずーっと電話してたら朝になっちゃってそのままずっと起きててハイテンションです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもこんなことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私妄想大好きでなりきり妄想ごっこをずっと電話でしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにくだらないです。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無駄な会話をずっとしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人何役もします。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう誰なのって人まで登場します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味不明なくらい笑います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑って笑って笑いすぎると、電話する前と電話した後で、体重が1キロ減ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今ご飯食べたから意味ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑うってすごーい。楽しいこと考えて楽しく過ごすって素晴らしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり私は常に楽しく生きていきたいなって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH30DJFX4W35D9YFYRTBP0A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそくアイスが好きすぎてつらいよーって気分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}